  "html": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"26928\" class=\"elementor elementor-26928\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b37a37ec e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b37a37ec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bcd4597 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7bcd4597\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d13760e elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"4d13760e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Digital Marketing Services&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">Austin</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Digital Marketing Services</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afb0609a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"afb0609a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Zoot Web Agency provides <a href=\"/austin-digital-marketing-agency/\">Austin digital marketing</a> services to Austin businesses across every major online channel—SEO, web design, paid advertising, and social media. We work with local businesses in healthcare, legal, home services, construction, and professional services who need to grow their online presence and generate consistent, qualified leads.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b822a55a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b822a55a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33422915 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"33422915\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cf59910 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"5cf59910\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Available to Austin Businesses&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">The Digital Marketing Channels</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Available to Austin Businesses</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-696141b1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"696141b1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These are the core channels where we work. Each one operates differently, converts at different points in the buying journey, and requires a different type of specialist to manage well.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da2c85ca e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"da2c85ca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46d9c4c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"46d9c4c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSearch Engine Optimisation\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSEO positions your Austin business in Google search results for the terms your customers are actively searching. It takes time — typically three to six months before rankings move meaningfully — but it compounds. Businesses that invest in SEO build an organic traffic asset that produces leads month after month without paying per click.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c45dc41 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"9c45dc41\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWeb Design &amp; Development\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA website is the hub every other digital marketing channel points to. If it loads slowly, confuses visitors, or lacks clear conversion paths, the traffic you generate from SEO, ads, and social doesn't convert. We build on WordPress — fast, editable, and properly structured for search engines from day one.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1733b636 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"1733b636\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPay-Per-Click Advertising\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tGoogle Ads and Meta Ads produce leads immediately — but only when managed correctly. The most common failure in PPC is spending on the wrong keywords and sending that traffic to pages that don't convert. We audit existing accounts, fix the structural problems, and build campaigns around the search terms that actually generate business in Austin.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41105dcb elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"41105dcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial Media Marketing\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial works differently depending on the business category. B2B firms need a different social strategy than a Austin restaurant or retail brand. We figure out where your audience actually spends time online and build content and paid campaigns that reach them with the right message.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53ed49a7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"53ed49a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90739eaf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"90739eaf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f412c4da elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"f412c4da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Is More Competitive Than Most Markets&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">Why Digital Marketing in Austin</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Is More Competitive Than Most Markets</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-409f8c26 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"409f8c26\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Austin creates a digital marketing environment where standing out requires more than just showing up. In most service categories, you&#8217;re competing against businesses that have been investing in their online presence for years.</p><p>Law firms in Austin run Google Ads with substantial monthly budgets. Large contractors have SEO agencies working on their sites continuously. Medical practices have content teams producing pages that answer every question a potential patient might search. If your business is newer to digital marketing, you&#8217;re entering a market where the competition has a head start — which makes strategy and execution more important, not less.</p><p>The good news is that most of that competition is beatable. Heavy spending doesn&#8217;t automatically mean smart spending. We&#8217;ve audited enough Austin Google Ads accounts and websites to know that most businesses are leaving significant ROI on the table through poor keyword targeting, weak landing pages, and campaigns that haven&#8217;t been properly optimised. That gap is the opportunity.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c16bf6e6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c16bf6e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-445b9731 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"445b9731\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1540b5e elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"b1540b5e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Digital Marketing Agency&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What to Look For in a Austin</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Digital Marketing Agency</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a292c7b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a292c7b6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Austin has no shortage of digital marketing agencies. These are the questions that separate agencies that produce results from those that produce reports.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-107b7976 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"107b7976\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d74ba736 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"d74ba736\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMonth-to-Month Contracts\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAn agency confident in its results offers month-to-month contracts. Long-term lock-ins protect the agency, not you. If an agency requires a 12-month commitment before you've seen a single result, that's worth noting. The best agencies earn renewal every month because the work keeps producing.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-103afd11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"103afd11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClear Reporting on Actual Outcomes\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDigital marketing generates a lot of data. The question is whether your agency reports on metrics that connect to your business — leads generated, rankings moved, revenue influenced — or metrics that look impressive but don't tell you whether the investment is paying off. Ask to see a sample report before committing.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1209e36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"a1209e36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA Dedicated Account Manager\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tThe person who sold you the engagement shouldn't disappear after signing. A dedicated account manager who knows your business, your goals, and your competitive landscape is the difference between generic strategy and strategy that fits your actual situation. Support tickets and rotating contacts are a sign that you're one of many accounts no one is truly accountable for.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7acfbb2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"e7acfbb2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDocumented Case Studies\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAny agency can claim results. Ask for specific examples: client category, what the situation was before, what changed, and what the numbers showed. Results from industries similar to yours carry more weight than general claims. If the case studies can't be shared or don't exist, that's useful information.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d76fc57 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9d76fc57\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cee48ac4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cee48ac4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2c6b94c elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"d2c6b94c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Austin Businesses&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">How Zoot Web Agency Works With</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Austin Businesses</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-921fc4fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"921fc4fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We start with a free audit — your website, search rankings, Google Business Profile, and any existing ad accounts. The audit takes a few days and gives us a clear picture of where your business stands online, what your competitors are doing, and where the biggest opportunities are for your specific situation in Austin.</p><p>From there we put together a proposal that reflects what we actually found — not a packaged service list. Some Austin businesses need SEO first. Others need a website rebuild before any other channel is worth investing in. Others are ready to run paid ads and just need a properly managed account. We tell you what we think makes sense and why, and you decide what to proceed with.</p><p>Once we&#8217;re working together, you get a named account manager — someone who knows your business and who you can contact directly. Monthly reporting covers what we did, what it produced, and what we&#8217;re doing next. We work month to month, so if the results aren&#8217;t there, you can leave.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb622726 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"eb622726\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cc9827e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4cc9827e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a95c4252 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-headline--style-highlight elementor-widget elementor-widget-animated-headline\" data-id=\"a95c4252\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;marker&quot;:&quot;underline&quot;,&quot;highlighted_text&quot;:&quot; Austin Clients&quot;,&quot;headline_style&quot;:&quot;highlight&quot;,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;highlight_animation_duration&quot;:1200,&quot;highlight_iteration_delay&quot;:8000}\" data-widget_type=\"animated-headline.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-headline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-plain-text elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">What Results Look Like for</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-wrapper elementor-headline-text-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-headline-dynamic-text elementor-headline-text-active\"> Austin Clients</span>\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9df738f1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9df738f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Results vary by channel and category — but these are the kinds of outcomes Austin businesses work with us to achieve.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8735043 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f8735043\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cebed02a elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"cebed02a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSEO: Organic Traffic Growth\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor a Austin contractor with minimal organic presence, 12 months of focused SEO work produced a 480% increase in organic traffic and moved them from page three to page one for their core service terms. The compound nature of SEO means those rankings keep working every month.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21f01228 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"21f01228\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPPC: Cost Per Lead Reduction\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Austin law firm came to us after two years of Google Ads management that produced high traffic but poor conversion. After rebuilding the account structure and creating dedicated landing pages, cost per qualified lead dropped by 62% in the first quarter.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26abd9cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"26abd9cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWeb Design: Conversion Rate Improvement\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Austin medical practice had a high-traffic website that generated almost no online enquiries. A full site rebuild with clear service pages and proper conversion paths produced a 3.4x increase in contact form submissions in the first month after launch.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d58fb183 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"d58fb183\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSocial Media: Lead Generation\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tA Austin home services company started social media from zero. Within six months, a consistent strategy on Instagram and Facebook was generating 15 to 20 qualified enquiries per month through direct messages and link clicks — without paid advertising.\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
}
